    "content": {
     "content_type": "text",
     "parts": [
      "Yes — if you're saying **“UPI ID கிடையாது” (there is no UPI ID)** because what you're seeing has **no `@`**, that can make sense.\n\nA **traditional UPI ID/VPA normally contains `@`**, for example `name@okaxis` or `9876543210@ybl`.\n\nBut you might instead be looking at a **UPI Number/mobile number, bank account number, transaction/reference ID, or another payment identifier**. Those **do not necessarily contain `@`**.\n\nIf you send me **the exact text or a screenshot** (hide account numbers/other sensitive details if needed), I can tell you what it is and why there is no `@`."
     ]
    },
    "create_time": 1786443550.034537,
    "id": "73aa0ae9-aa93-4043-8cd4-1f3b68214cd5",
