  },
  "ab99a317-854e-41ac-94bb-6121e08fb563": {
   "id": "ab99a317-854e-41ac-94bb-6121e08fb563",
   "message": {
    "author": {
     "name": null,
     "role": "assistant"
    },
    "content": {
     "content_type": "text",
     "parts": [
      "Yes. **A UPI ID normally contains `@`**.\n\nTypical format:\n\n**`username@provider`**\n\nExamples:\n- `9876543210@paytm`\n- `name@okhdfcbank`\n- `name@oksbi`\n- `name@ybl`\n- `mobilenumber@upi`\n\nThe part **before `@`** identifies you, and the part **after `@`** is the UPI handle/provider.\n\nIf you paste the UPI ID you have (you can hide a few characters), I can tell you whether **the format looks valid and which provider/bank the `@...` belongs to**."
     ]
    },
